            <ArticleTitle>Pain scales in children: a review.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>341-50</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This is a review of tools that have been developed to assess pain in children, with a brief evaluation of their practicality and validity. There are some suggestions for the direction of future research in the development and use of the scales.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
